  m_Name: Nerea_Thoughts
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  loadMode: 1
  saveMode: 1
  saveInterval: 120
  subFolder: Characters/Nerea
  maxEntries: 5
  summary: 
  entries:
  - 
  - I wonder if Sans is still stuck in his joke-telling routine... maybe I can bring
    some new ideas to the table.
  - I hope Sans isn't just trying to be funny again... I want us to have a real conversation
    about this. What if his jokes are exactly what the island needs? Maybe they can
    help bring people together...
  - "Me preocupa que Elian no entienda mi pasi\xF3n por proteger la isla y el mar.
    Espero que pueda escucharme y apoyarme en mis esfuerzos."
  - Ah, someone new to talk to! I've always been fascinated by people who have a
    deep connection with nature. His story is so intriguing...
  - "Es alguien nuevo en la isla. No s\xE9 qu\xE9 quiere, pero espero que no sea
    para da\xF1ar el mar."
  - "Me alegra ver su entusiasmo. Espero que no est\xE9 pensando solo en pescar y
    olvidarse de la belleza del litoral."
  - "\xBFPor qu\xE9 no les importa a ellos? \xA1Es como si no viesen el mar por dentro!"
